==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|гос-во<q:abbreviation>}}

===Etymology===
{{ety|ru|:af|госуда́рь|-ство}}
{{af|ru|госуда́рь|gloss1=sovereign|-ство}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|госуда́рство}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-государство.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Lvova-государство.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|госуда́рство|adj=госуда́рственный}}

# {{lb|ru|government}} [[State]]
#* {{quote-book|ru|year= 1969|origyear= 1917|author= w:Vladimir Lenin|chapter= V.4.|title= w:ru:Государство и революция|series= В. И. Ленин – Полное собрание сочинений|seriesvolume= 33|page= 95|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/28_20201018_20201018_1648/%D0%9B%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BD%20%D0%92.%D0%98._%D0%9F%D0%A1%D0%A1%20%D1%82.%2033/page/94/mode/2up
|newversion= English translation from|year2= 1974|title2= w:The State and Revolution|series2= V. I. Lenin – Collected Works|seriesvolume2= 25|page2= 473|pageurl2= https://archive.org/details/LeninCW/Lenin%20CW-Vol.%2025/page/n477/mode/2up
|text= [[пока|Пока́]] есть '''госуда́рство''', [[нет]] [[свобода|свобо́ды]]. [[когда|Когда́]] [[быть|бу́дет]] [[свобо́да]], [[не]] [[быть|бу́дет]] '''госуда́рства'''.
|t= So long as the '''state''' exists there is no freedom. When there is freedom, there will be no '''state'''.}}

