==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{etymon|ru|id=country|:inh|orv:страна}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|страна}}, borrowed from {{der|ru|cu|страна}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*storna}}. Compare the regular East-Slavic reflex with {{w|pleophony}} {{doublet|ru|сторона́|notext=1}}.

Compare typologically {{m+|en|country}} (<< {{m+|la|contrā}}). Also compare {{m|ru|окра́ина}}, {{m|ru|край}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|страна́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-страна.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|d|страна́|adj=страново́й}}

# [[country]]
# [[region]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[четы́ре]] [[страна света|страны́ све́та]]|the four [[cardinal point]]s}}

