==Russian==

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ru|orv|такъ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*takъ}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ru-IPA|тако́й}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-такой.ogg}}

====Determiner====
{{etymid|ru|determiner}}
{{head|ru|determiner|head=тако́й|g=m}}

# [[such]] (a), [[such]], [[that]]/[[this]] [[kind]]/[[sort]]/[[type]] of, [[those]]/[[these]] [[kind]]s/[[sort]]s/[[type]]s of, [[like that]]/[[this]]/[[those]]/[[these]]; ''in the negative also:'' no [[such]] {{q|often translated as simply "that" or "this", meaning not only the specific thing in question but also any instance of that thing resembling it}}
#: {{syn|ru|подо́бный|'''тако́го''' [[ро́да]]}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[в]] '''тако́м''' [[слу́чае]]|in '''that''' case}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[в]] '''таку́ю''' [[рань]]|at '''this''' (early) hour}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[при]] '''таки́х''' [[обстоя́тельствах]]|in/under '''these'''/'''such''' circumstances}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[мы|Мы]] [[не]] [[смо́жем]] [[поддержа́ть]] '''тако́е''' [[предложе́ние]].|We cannot support '''such''' a proposal.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[нет|Нет]] '''тако́го''' [[сло́ва]].|That word doesn't exist.|lit=There's no '''such''' word.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[для|Для]] [[многие|мно́гих]] '''тако́й''' [[о́пыт]] [[весьма́]] [[необы́чен]].|For many, '''this''' experience (an experience '''like this''') is highly unusual.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[таблица|Табли́ца]] [[пока́зывает]], [[как]] [[мы]] [[пришли́]] [[к]] '''тако́му''' [[вы́воду]].|The table shows how we came to '''this''' conclusion (a conclusion '''like this''').}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[тут|Тут]] '''тако́е''' [[де́ло]].|Here's the thing/deal.|lit='''This''' thing/deal is here. / A thing/deal '''like this''' is here.}}
# {{lb|ru|before a [[w:Content clause|content clause]] beginning with {{m|ru|что}} or {{m|ru|что́бы}}}} [[such]] (a), [[such]] ({{n-g|used to indicate a sufficient degree of something, such that the following clause is true}})
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ты|Ты]] '''тако́й''' [[дура́к]], [[что]] [[не]] [[понима́ешь]] [[э́того]]?|Are you '''such''' a fool that you don't understand this?}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[они|Они́]] [[нака́пливаются]] [[до]] '''тако́й''' [[сте́пени]], [[что]] [[стано́вится]] [[невозможный|невозмо́жным]] [[их]] [[терпе́ть]].|They accumulate to the point (to '''such''' an extent) that it becomes impossible to bear them.}}
# {{lb|ru|after {{m|ru|кто}}}} {{n-g|used with a {{lg|pronoun}}, [[name#English|name]] or {{lg|noun}} to specify the meaning of {{m|ru|кто}} as "what's the nature/essence (of)" and not just a request to identify someone. Usually not translated.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[кто|Кто]] [[ты]] '''тако́й''', [[что́бы]] [[реша́ть]]?|Who are you to decide?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[она|Она́]] [[не]] [[зна́ет]], [[кто]] [[она́]] '''така́я''' [[и]] [[чего́]] [[хо́чет]].|She doesn't know who she is and what she wants.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[кто|Кто]] '''тако́й''' [[адвока́т]], [[и]] [[чем]] [[он]] [[занима́ется]]?|What is a lawyer, and what do they do?}}
# {{n-g|used with (usually after) a noun when speaking of the existence of something resembling what has just been observed or mentioned; usually not translated}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[тритоны|Трито́ны]], [[зна́ешь]], [[амфи́бии]] '''таки́е'''.|Newts, you know, those amphibians.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[что|Что]] [[э́то]] [[за]] [[игра́]] '''така́я'''?|What game is that?}}
#: {{ux|ru|— Ла-ла-ла. — [[это|Э́то]] [[пе́сня]] '''така́я'''?|— La-la-la. — Is that a song?}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} {{n-g|used after an adjective for intensification}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] [[говори́т]] [[сла́дким]] '''таки́м''' [[го́лосом]].|He speaks in this sweet voice.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[не́жный]] '''тако́й''' [[взгляд]]|a tender gaze}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial|often followed by {{m|ru|себе́}}}} a [[kind]]/[[sort]]/[[type]] of, [[some]] [[kind]]/[[sort]]/[[type]] of
#: {{syn|ru|како́й-то|не́который|своего́ ро́да}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[вода|Вода́]] [[в]] [[пруду́]] [[покры́лась]] [[плёнкой]] '''тако́й'''.|The water in the pool was covered with '''some kind of''' film.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[Википе́дия]] - [[э́то]] '''така́я''' [[себе́]] [[народный|наро́дная]] [[энциклопе́дия]], [[кото́рая]] [[править|пра́вится]] [[сами́ми]] [[по́льзователями]].|Wikipedia is '''a kind of''' people's encyclopaedia that is edited by users themselves.}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial|often followed by {{m|ru|себе́}}}} [[not]] [[great]], [[meh]], [[mediocre]], [[middling]], [[so-so]]
#: {{syn|ru|посре́дственный|сре́дний|сре́дненький}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] '''тако́й''' [[себе́]] [[актёр]].|He's not a great actor.}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{col4|ru
|есть така́я па́ртия
|тако́й-то
|тако́й-сяко́й
|тако́й же
|таки́м о́бразом
}}

====Pronoun====
{{etymid|ru|pronoun}}
{{head|ru|pronoun|head=тако́й|g=m|demonstrative}}

# [[like that]], [[like]] [[this]] {{q|sometimes translated as simply "that"/"those"" or "this"/"these"}}
#: {{syn|ru|тако́в}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[почему|Почему́]] [[ты]] '''тако́й'''?|Why are you '''like this'''?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Они́]] [[все]] '''таки́е'''.|They're all '''like that'''.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[вопрос|Вопро́с]] '''тако́й''': [[заче́м]] [[они́]] [[э́то]] [[де́лают]]?|The question is, why are they doing this?|lit=The question is '''this''': why are they doing this?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[моё|Моё]] [[мне́ние]] '''тако́е''': [[они́]] [[должны́]] [[прекрати́ть]].|My opinion is '''this''': they should stop.}}
# {{lb|ru|immediately before a [[w:Content clause|content clause]] beginning with {{m|ru|что}}}} [[such]] {{gl|in such a way that the following clause is true}}
#: {{syn|ru|тако́в}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ситуация|Ситуа́ция]] '''така́я''', [[что]] [[э́то]] [[невозмо́жно]].|The situation is '''such''' that this is not possible.}}
# {{lb|ru|immediately before a clause beginning with {{m|ru|како́в}}, {{m|ru|како́й}} or {{m|ru|как}}}} [[as]], the [[way]], [[like]] {{gl|in the way described in the following clause}}
#: {{syn|ru|тако́в}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Они́]] [[не]] [[совсе́м]] '''таки́е''', [[каки́ми]] [[я]] [[их]] [[представля́ла]].|They're not quite '''as''' I imagined them.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[дома|Дома́]] [[не]] '''таки́е''', [[как]] [[у]] [[нас]].|The houses aren't '''like''' ours / (the ones) we have.}}
# [[one]] [[like that]]/[[this]], [[ones]] [[like that]]/[[this]]
#: {{syn|ru|подо́бный}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[ви́дел]] [[мно́го]] [[фортепиа́но]], [[но]] '''тако́го''' [[никогда́]] [[не]] [[ви́дел]].|subst=фортепиа́но//фортэпиа́но|I've seen a lot of pianos, but I've never seen '''one like that'''.}}
# {{lb|ru|mostly {{lg|indefinite}}|before a {{lg|relative clause}}}} {{n-g|used to refer to any instance / instances of the noun in question or just spoken about, or, with {{m|ru|кто}}, any person/people, that fall(s) into a particular category}}
## [[one]]; ''in the plural:'' [[ones]], [[those]]
##: {{syn|ru|тот<q:more common>}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[лучший|Лу́чшая]] [[страте́гия]] - '''така́я''', [[кото́рая]] [[устро́ит]] [[всех]].|The best strategy is '''one''' that suits everyone.}}
##: {{ux|ru|[[нам|Нам]] [[сле́дует]] [[испо́льзовать]] [[прочный|про́чные]] [[ло́жки]], [[а]] [[не]] '''таки́е''', [[кото́рые]] [[легко́]] [[лома́ются]].|We should use strong spoons, and not '''those''' that break easily.}}
## {{lb|ru|before {{m|ru|кто}}}} [[someone]], a [[person]], [[anyone]], [[whoever]]; ''in the plural:'' [[those]], (the/those) [[people]], [[anyone]], [[whoever]], [[some]] (people)
##: {{syn|ru|кто́-либо|кто́-нибудь|кто́-то|лю́ди<q:plural>|тот<q:more common>|челове́к<q:singular>}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[вы|Вы]] [[не]] [[найдёте]] '''тако́го''', [[кто]] [[с удово́льствием]] [[пла́тит]] [[нало́ги]].|You won't find '''someone''' who enjoys paying taxes.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[есть|Есть]] '''таки́е''', [[кто]] [[ду́мает]], [[что]] [[мы]] [[сдади́мся]].|There are '''some (people)''' who think we'll give up.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[это|Э́то]] [[для]] '''таки́х''', [[кто]] [[лю́бит]] [[ру́сский]] [[язы́к]].|This is for '''those''' who love Russian.}}
# {{lb|ru|{{lg|indefinite}}|before a {{lg|relative clause}}}} {{n-g|used to refer to the kind/sort/type of the noun in question or just spoken about, or, with {{m|ru|кто}}, person/people, described in the following clause}}
## {{sid|ru|the kind}} the [[kind]]/[[sort]]/[[type]] (of [noun]), the [[kind]]s/[[sort]]s/[[type]]s (of [noun in plural])
##: {{syn|ru|тот<q:more common>}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[этот|Э́тот]] [[лёд]] [[не]] '''тако́й''', [[что]] [[мы]] [[де́лаем]] [[у]] [[себя́]] [[в]] [[холоди́льнике]].|This ice is not '''the kind (of ice)''' we make at home in the fridge.}}
## {{lb|ru|before {{m|ru|кто}}|can also be pluralised and placed after {{m|ru|из}} in the {{lg|genitive case}}}} the [[kind]]/[[sort]]/[[type]] of [[person]]/[[people]], the [[type]] (to), [[one]](s) (to)
##: {{syn|ru|кто́-то<q:uncommon>|лю́ди<q:plural>|тот<q:more common>|челове́к<q:singular>}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] [[не]] '''тако́й''', [[кто]] [[жа́луется]].|He's not '''the kind of person''' to complain.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Они́]] [[не]] '''таки́е''', [[кто]] [[жа́луется]].|They're not '''the type of people''' to complain.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] [[не]] [[из]] '''таки́х''', [[кто]] [[жа́луется]].|He's not the kind of person to complain.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* See {{m|ru|тако́е|id=pronoun}} for additional pronoun senses specific to the neuter singular.
* Even when used in the plural, if {{m|ru|кто}} follows, the remaining clause is in the singular: {{m|ru|'''таки́е''' (plural), [[кто]] [[лю́бит]] (singular)|tr=takíje, kto ljúbit|t=those (plural) who love (singular)}}.
* When {{m|ru|кто}} is used after {{m-self|ru|тако́й}}, {{m-self|ru|тако́й}} is implied to mean a person or people: {{m|ru|'''таки́е''', [[кто]] [[лю́бит]] [[сноубо́рдинг]]|t=those (people) who love snowboarding}}. {{m|ru|который|Кото́рый}} is used after {{m-self|ru|тако́й}} when {{m-self|ru|тако́й}} refers to a particular noun that has been mentioned (which could still be a category of people, or even the word "people", {{m|ru|лю́ди}}): {{m|ru|[[что]] [[каса́ется]] [[терапе́втов]], [[есть]] '''таки́е''', [[кото́рые]] [[не]] [[помога́ют]]|t=when it comes to therapists (a particular noun), there are some (of that noun) that don't help}}. {{m|ru|что|Что}} after {{m-self|ru|тако́й}} can also be used in either case but may be seen as archaic or colloquial.

